WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:26.776 --> 00:00:27.944
Because that light

00:00:28.778 --> 00:00:32.782
was slowly drawing closer to the ship.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.790
What appeared
before the astonished sailors...

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:42.709
Was...

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:44.836
-...a glittering dragon!
-a glittering dragon!

00:00:57.015 --> 00:00:58.058
Amazing...

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:14.699
Everyone, look port side!

00:01:14.824 --> 00:01:15.617
What is it?

00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:20.413
Is that...?

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:22.749
I can't believe it.

00:01:33.009 --> 00:01:33.843
Crocco!

00:01:34.177 --> 00:01:38.014
-Yeah, I see it.
-Let's hunt it!

00:01:39.057 --> 00:01:41.392
Are you kidding?!
In the middle of a storm?

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:43.686
How are we supposed to hunt it?

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.605
We have to hurry or it'll get away!

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:46.564
Are you crazy?!

00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:48.024
Just bring the ship closer!

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:49.692
-I can't do that!
-Move, Mika!

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:53.613
Crocco, the dragon will lead us to safety!

00:01:54.239 --> 00:01:57.033
We'll be able to make it out of the storm!

00:01:59.202 --> 00:02:00.870
Are you serious?

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:05.041
It's possible the dragon would know
to avoid the storm clouds!

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:06.376
Sounds interesting.

00:02:07.043 --> 00:02:08.086
We should trust him.

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:11.965
Captain, we'd make a huge profit
if we hunted that dragon!

00:02:12.048 --> 00:02:14.092
That's enough!

00:02:19.055 --> 00:02:20.807
Giraud, hold down the fort here.

00:02:21.057 --> 00:02:22.767
Hey, Mika?

